*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
